@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness (dependencies)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### US-02 - rate calculation (contract from SPEC.md section 4)
POST {{host}}/api/rates/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceType": "ColdChain",
  "originZip": "33101",
  "destinationZip": "32801",
  "weightLbs": 35000,
  "targetTemperatureCelsius": -20.0
}

### FDE - load creation requires an Idempotency-Key
POST {{host}}/api/loads
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f2504e0-4f89-11d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301

{}

### US-04 - landing page lead capture
POST {{host}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Apex Construction",
  "contactEmail": "contact@apex.com",
  "verticalSlug": "fdot-concrete-barricades",
  "serviceType": "FdotConcrete",
  "cargoDetails": "120 concrete Jersey barricades, Orlando to Tampa"
}
